<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 02:06:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>波兰总理警告俄罗斯正计划在“喀尔巴阡八国”会议期间对支持乌克兰的欧洲国家进行无人机或火箭袭击</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/polish-prime-minister-russia-hybrid-war-drone-rocket-strikes-european-countries-ukraine/</link><description>欧盟委员会主席乌苏拉·冯德莱恩周三表示，欧盟需要一个类似北约的机制，以更好地应对归咎于俄罗斯的混合攻击。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295272807-e1789856557402.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:28:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/polish-prime-minister-russia-hybrid-war-drone-rocket-strikes-european-countries-ukraine/</guid></item><item><title>在拒绝放慢工业发展的呼吁后，特朗普发誓要建立一支“人工智能部队”，并向司法系统致敬。 “相反，我们会珍惜它”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-ai-force-czar-law-enforcement-role-slowdown-development/</link><description>特朗普在 Truth Social 上发帖称：“我们不会以任何方式阻碍或扼杀这个令人难以置信的行业的增长。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295317313-e1789852938799.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:13:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/trump-ai-force-czar-law-enforcement-role-slowdown-development/</guid></item><item><title>仲裁员称 Uber 对司机在致命事故中的疏忽负有“替代责任”，并驳斥了该公司是一家科技平台的说法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/arbitrator-uber-vicariously-liable-driver-negligence-fatal-accident/</link><description>一名 23 岁女性的 Uber 司机在南加州高速公路上停车后被撞身亡，她的父母获得了 4000 万美元的赔偿。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26261795737103.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:05:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/arbitrator-uber-vicariously-liable-driver-negligence-fatal-accident/</guid></item><item><title>诺贝尔奖获得者表示，自战争开始以来，伊朗对社会的镇压有所加剧，但“人民的抵抗浪潮”正在兴起</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/nobel-laureate-narges-mohammadi-iran-repression-us-war-resistance/</link><description>54 岁的纳尔吉斯·穆罕默迪 (Narges Mohammadi) 荣获 2023 年诺贝尔和平奖，今年早些时候因健康原因暂时出狱。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26262455449680-e1789850421627.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:51:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/nobel-laureate-narges-mohammadi-iran-repression-us-war-resistance/</guid></item><item><title>诉讼称 Anthropic、OpenAI、SpaceXAI 和谷歌在协调 AI 放缓、降低订阅价值时违反了反垄断法</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/lawsuit-anthropic-openai-spacexai-google-antitrust-laws-ai-slowdown-subscription-value/</link><description>诉讼中的原告声称，他们并不反对人工智能公司要求国会、白宫或任何其他机构制定人工智能监管。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26262593036783-e1789849457140.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:34:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/lawsuit-anthropic-openai-spacexai-google-antitrust-laws-ai-slowdown-subscription-value/</guid></item><item><title>美国国债收益率已经超出了国会预算办公室的长期预测，此前淡化美国债务担忧的专家现在开始担心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/treasury-yields-cbo-forecasts-us-debt-interest-costs-deficits/</link><description>“如果利息引发债务，债务又引发利息，最终债务将失控。曾经不可想象的财政危机现在已成为一种明显的可能性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295424378-e1789842889208.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:31:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/treasury-yields-cbo-forecasts-us-debt-interest-costs-deficits/</guid></item><item><title>在被艾德·希兰抛弃之前，麦克莫尔长期以来一直支持巴勒斯坦人，他最新的礼物促使 YouTube 明星雷切尔女士捐款</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/ed-sheeran-tour-robert-kraft-macklemore-palestinians-israel-gaza/</link><description>麦克莫尔因在新泽西大都会人寿体育场的舞台上发表亲巴勒斯坦言论而被除名后，承诺捐出埃德·希兰环巡赛的净收入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26261805978425-e1789841338253.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 18:19:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/ed-sheeran-tour-robert-kraft-macklemore-palestinians-israel-gaza/</guid></item><item><title>诺贝尔奖获得者表示，加州的亿万富翁税将“启动一场运动”，波及更多州、联邦政府和其他国家</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/california-billionaire-wealth-tax-prop-40-movement-more-states-federal-government-other-countries/</link><description>“过去几十年来，该州亿万富翁的爆炸式增长使其成为美国最不平等的地方之一。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2242238651-e1789834007895.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:57:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/california-billionaire-wealth-tax-prop-40-movement-more-states-federal-government-other-countries/</guid></item><item><title>中央司令部表示，过去两个月，美军已协助通过霍尔木兹海峡运输了 10 亿桶石油，而伊朗“出口为零”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/central-command-us-military-transit-1-billion-barrels-oil-hormuz-iran-exports-naval-blockade/</link><description>布拉德·库珀海军上将表示，过去两周的石油、天然气和货物过境量达到六个月来的最高水平。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9923657.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:30:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/central-command-us-military-transit-1-billion-barrels-oil-hormuz-iran-exports-naval-blockade/</guid></item><item><title>随着人工智能公司越来越接近“递归自我完善”，这位物理学教授称完全自主是“人类历史上最糟糕的想法”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/what-is-self-improvement-rsi-full-autonomy-openai-anthropic-xai/</link><description>人工智能模型自主学习以提高效率和能力的前景似乎越来越接近现实。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26255587007476-e1789830477374.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:18:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/what-is-self-improvement-rsi-full-autonomy-openai-anthropic-xai/</guid></item></channel></rss>